    {
      "title": "Historical source code snapshot (not executable in AWS)",
      "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Aza'raan Word Generation System</title>\n<style>\nbody {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #0d1117;\n    color: #e6edf3;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n}\n\nheader {\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg,#111827,#1f2937);\n    padding: 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #374151;\n}\n\n.container {\n    width: 95%;\n    max-width: 1600px;\n    margin: auto;\n    padding: 20px;\n}\n\n.panel {\n    background: #161b22;\n    border: 1px solid #30363d;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 18px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\nh2 {\n    margin-top: 0;\n    color: #7dd3fc;\n}\n\nselect,\ninput {\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 12px;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n    background: #0d1117;\n    color: white;\n    border: 1px solid #374151;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n}\n\nbutton {\n    cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.letter-grid {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.letter-btn {\n    min-width: 52px;\n    height: 52px;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    background: #1f2937;\n    color: white;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    transition: .2s;\n}\n\n.letter-btn:hover {\n    background: #2563eb;\n}\n\n.letter-btn.active {\n    background: #10b981;\n    color: black;\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n.generate-btn {\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 18px;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    background: #7c3aed;\n    color: white;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n}\n\n.generate-btn:hover {\n    background: #8b5cf6;\n}\n\n.result {\n    font-size: 48px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    color: #facc15;\n    word-break: break-word;\n}\n\n.meta {\n    margin-top: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n}\n\n.dictionary {\n    max-height: 400px;\n    overflow-y: auto;\n    border: 1px solid #374151;\n    padding: 10px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n}\n\n.entry {\n    background: #111827;\n    padding: 12px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.delete-btn {\n    background: #dc2626;\n    color: white;\n    border: none;\n    padding: 8px 14px;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n}\n\n.rule-box {\n    background: #111827;\n    border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed;\n    padding: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<header>Aza’raan Word Generation System</header>\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<h2>Generation Controls</h2>\n\n<label>Syllables</label>\n<select id=\"syllables\">\n<option value=\"1\">1 Syllable</option>\n<option value=\"2\">2 Syllables</option>\n<option value=\"3\">3 Syllables</option>\n</select>\n\n<label>Part of Speech</label>\n<select id=\"partOfSpeech\">\n<option value=\"noun\">Noun</option>\n<option value=\"particle\">Particle</option>\n</select>\n\n<div id=\"nounSection\">\n<label>Noun Category</label>\n<select id=\"nounCategory\"></select>\n\n<label>Noun Subcategory</label>\n<select id=\"nounSubcategory\"></select>\n\n<label>Specific Meaning</label>\n<select id=\"nounMeaning\"></select>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"particleSection\" style=\"display:none;\">\n<label>Particle Category</label>\n<select id=\"particleCategory\"></select>\n\n<label>Particle Subcategory</label>\n<select id=\"particleSubcategory\"></select>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<h2>Modern family letters and accented readings (2036 CE)</h2>\n<p>Each of the 55 options belongs to one of 21 letter families. All readings in a multi-reading family are accented, including the primary reading. Only H, L, P, U and Z appear unaccented.</p>\n<div class=\"letter-grid\" id=\"letterGrid\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<h2>Special signs (optional)</h2>\n<p>Glottal apostrophe <code>'</code>, click <code>¡</code>, previous-syllable emphasis <code>&lt;</code>, next-syllable emphasis <code>&gt;</code>. These are not extra letters.</p>\n<div class=\"letter-grid\" id=\"specialGrid\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<h2>Syllable Construction Rules</h2>\n<div class=\"rule-box\">Select 1 to 4 sound-bearing letter variants per syllable. At least as many letters as syllables must be selected. Optional special signs are inserted between or next to letters; they do not count as vowels or consonants. Generated vocabulary is a draft and not automatically canon.</div>\n<p><strong>Era history:</strong> 52 original hieroglyphs → Ancient 52 → Archaic 49 → Classical 44 → Traditional 32 → Modern 21 (55 accented/unaccented readings).</p>\n</div>\n\n<button class=\"generate-btn\" onclick=\"generateWord()\">Generate Aza’raan Word</button>\n\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<h2>Generated Word</h2>\n<div class=\"result\" id=\"result\"> - </div>\n<div class=\"meta\" id=\"meta\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<h2>Dictionary Database</h2>\n<div class=\"dictionary\" id=\"dictionary\"></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\nconst modernLetterEntries = [{\"family\": \"A\", \"reading\": \"AE\", \"surface\": \"Ą\"}, {\"family\": \"A\", \"reading\": \"AY\", \"surface\": \"Á\"}, {\"family\": \"A\", \"reading\": \"AW\", \"surface\": \"Â\"}, {\"family\": \"A\", \"reading\": \"AY-EH\", \"surface\": \"Ǎ\"}, {\"family\": \"A\", \"reading\": \"AH\", \"surface\": \"Ā\"}, {\"family\": \"B\", \"reading\": \"B\", \"surface\": \"B̀\"}, {\"family\": \"B\", \"reading\": \"V\", \"surface\": \"Ḃ\"}, {\"family\": \"B\", \"reading\": \"F\", \"surface\": \"B̵\"}, {\"family\": \"B\", \"reading\": \"WH\", \"surface\": \"B̆\"}, {\"family\": \"D\", \"reading\": \"D\", \"surface\": \"D̵\"}, {\"family\": \"D\", \"reading\": \"DZ\", \"surface\": \"Ď\"}, {\"family\": \"E\", \"reading\": \"EH\", \"surface\": \"Ę\"}, {\"family\": \"E\", \"reading\": \"EE\", \"surface\": \"Ē\"}, {\"family\": \"G\", \"reading\": \"G\", \"surface\": \"G̵\"}, {\"family\": \"G\", \"reading\": \"GH\", \"surface\": \"G̀\"}, {\"family\": \"H\", \"reading\": \"H\", \"surface\": \"H\"}, {\"family\": \"I\", \"reading\": \"IH\", \"surface\": \"Ĭ\"}, {\"family\": \"I\", \"reading\": \"EYE\", \"surface\": \"Î\"}, {\"family\": \"J\", \"reading\": \"J\", \"surface\": \"J̌\"}, {\"family\": \"J\", \"reading\": \"ZH\", \"surface\": \"J̧\"}, {\"family\": \"K\", \"reading\": \"K\", \"surface\": \"K̵\"}, {\"family\": \"K\", \"reading\": \"KW\", \"surface\": \"K̈\"}, {\"family\": \"K\", \"reading\": \"KEY\", \"surface\": \"Ḱ\"}, {\"family\": \"K\", \"reading\": \"KS\", \"surface\": \"Ǩ\"}, {\"family\": \"L\", \"reading\": \"L\", \"surface\": \"L\"}, {\"family\": \"M\", \"reading\": \"M\", \"surface\": \"Ṁ\"}, {\"family\": \"M\", \"reading\": \"MN\", \"surface\": \"M̌\"}, {\"family\": \"N\", \"reading\": \"N\", \"surface\": \"Ṅ\"}, {\"family\": \"N\", \"reading\": \"NG\", \"surface\": \"Ñ\"}, {\"family\": \"N\", \"reading\": \"NY\", \"surface\": \"Ņ\"}, {\"family\": \"O\", \"reading\": \"OO\", \"surface\": \"Ō\"}, {\"family\": \"O\", \"reading\": \"OH\", \"surface\": \"Ó\"}, {\"family\": \"O\", \"reading\": \"OW\", \"surface\": \"Ô\"}, {\"family\": \"O\", \"reading\": \"OY\", \"surface\": \"Ǒ\"}, {\"family\": \"P\", \"reading\": \"P\", \"surface\": \"P\"}, {\"family\": \"R\", \"reading\": \"RR\", \"surface\": \"R̄\"}, {\"family\": \"R\", \"reading\": \"ER\", \"surface\": \"R̆\"}, {\"family\": \"S\", \"reading\": \"S\", \"surface\": \"S̵\"}, {\"family\": \"S\", \"reading\": \"SH\", \"surface\": \"Ş\"}, {\"family\": \"T\", \"reading\": \"T\", \"surface\": \"T̆\"}, {\"family\": \"T\", \"reading\": \"TH\", \"surface\": \"T̵\"}, {\"family\": \"T\", \"reading\": \"TCH\", \"surface\": \"Ť\"}, {\"family\": \"T\", \"reading\": \"TAZ\", \"surface\": \"T́\"}, {\"family\": \"U\", \"reading\": \"UH\", \"surface\": \"U\"}, {\"family\": \"W\", \"reading\": \"WOO\", \"surface\": \"W̄\"}, {\"family\": \"W\", \"reading\": \"WOE\", \"surface\": \"Ẃ\"}, {\"family\": \"W\", \"reading\": \"WIH\", \"surface\": \"W̆\"}, {\"family\": \"W\", \"reading\": \"WAH\", \"surface\": \"Ẁ\"}, {\"family\": \"W\", \"reading\": \"WEE\", \"surface\": \"Ẅ\"}, {\"family\": \"Y\", \"reading\": \"YOO\", \"surface\": \"Ȳ\"}, {\"family\": \"Y\", \"reading\": \"YO\", \"surface\": \"Ý\"}, {\"family\": \"Y\", \"reading\": \"YIH\", \"surface\": \"Y̆\"}, {\"family\": \"Y\", \"reading\": \"YA\", \"surface\": \"Ỳ\"}, {\"family\": \"Y\", \"reading\": \"YE\", \"surface\": \"Y̨\"}, {\"family\": \"Z\", \"reading\": \"Z\", \"surface\": \"Z\"}];\nconst availableSpecialSigns = [\"'\", \"¡\", \"<\", \">\"]; // U+0027, U+00A1, U+003C, U+003E\nconst selected = {letters: [], specials: []};\n\nconst nounData = {\n'Matter and Physical Substance': {\n'States of Matter': [\n'Solid Matter','Stone','Crystal','Metal','Wood','Bone','Ice','Glass','Clay','Compact dust mass','Salt formation',\n'Water','Blood','Oil','Sap','Mud','Acid','Lava','Ink','Mercury','Resin',\n'Steam','Smoke','Mist','Fog','Cloud vapor','Poison gas','Breath','Ash cloud','Sulfur vapor',\n'Lightning','Fire plasma','Solar flame','Aurora','Arc discharge','Magical energy field'\n]\n},\n'Water Formations': {\n'Flowing Water Bodies': [\n'Brook','Creek','Stream','Runoff channel','River','Branch river','Canal','Underground river','Rapids','Waterfall','Flood surge','Whirlpool current'\n],\n'Standing Water Bodies': [\n'Pond','Pool','Spring basin','Lake','Reservoir','Crater lake','Sea','Ocean','Inland sea'\n],\n'Frozen Water Bodies': [\n'Glacier','Ice shelf','Frozen lake','Snow field','Iceberg','Drift ice','Pack ice'\n]\n},\n'Landmass and Terrain': {\n'Continental Structures': [\n'Continent','Supercontinent','Subcontinent','Peninsula','Land bridge'\n],\n'Islands': [\n'Island','Archipelago member','Floating island','Sky island','Levitation stone mass','Volcanic island','Caldera island'\n],\n'Elevated Terrain': [\n'Hill','Mound','Ridge','Mountain','Mountain chain','Plateau','Peak','Cliff face','Spire rock'\n]\n},\n'Biological Life': {\n'Flora': [\n'Hardwood tree','Softwood tree','Fruit tree','Ancient tree','Grass','Flower','Fern','Moss','Vine','Creeper','Root network','Seaweed','Kelp','Lotus','Algae','Mushroom','Mold','Spore bloom','Lichen'\n],\n'Fauna': [\n'Predator mammal','Herbivore mammal','Burrowing mammal','Flying mammal','Snake','Lizard','Crocodilian','Dragon-type reptile','Songbird','Raptor','Water bird','Flightless bird','Fish','Whale','Cephalopod','Crustacean','Ant','Beetle','Butterfly','Hive insect','Frog','Salamander','Marsh predator'\n],\n'Sapient Life': [\n'Ghost','Ancestor spirit','Soul fragment','Possessed vessel','Construct mind','Machine consciousness','Artificial spirit'\n]\n},\n'Civilization and Governance': {\n'Settlements': ['Camp','Village','Town','City','Fortified city variants'],\n'Political Structures': ['Local governance systems','Regional governance systems','National governance systems','Sacred governance systems'],\n'Institutions': ['Educational','Judicial','Military','Economic']\n},\n'Structures and Architecture': {\n'General': ['Residential structure','Religious structure','Industrial structure','Transportation structure','Burial structure']\n},\n'Celestial and Cosmic Objects': {\n'Cosmic Objects': ['Star','Planetary body','Moon','Asteroid','Comet','Galaxy','Nebula','Black void region']\n},\n'Time and Temporal Concepts': {\n'Temporal States': ['Past','Present','Future','Time loop','Fractured time']\n},\n'Emotional and Psychological Concepts': {\n'Emotions': ['Joy','Fear','Grief','Rage','Peace','Ecstasy']\n},\n'Energy and Force': {\n'Natural and Magical Forces': ['Storm force','Earth force','Mana','Soul energy','Divine light']\n},\n'Sound and Communication': {\n'Communication': ['Speech','Whisper','Cry','Instrumental resonance']\n},\n'Knowledge and Abstraction': {\n'Abstract Concepts': ['Logic','Memory','Existence','Social contract']\n},\n'Technology and Tools': {\n'Tools': ['Hand tool','Machine','Mechanical system']\n},\n'Transportation': {\n'Transport': ['Land transport','Water transport','Air transport','Living mount']\n},\n'Sacred and Supernatural Categories': {\n'Supernatural': ['Divine entity','Miracle','Curse','Portal','Dimensional event']\n},\n'Material Value Categories': {\n'Value': ['Currency','Precious mineral','Precious organic material']\n},\n'Food and Consumption': {\n'Food': ['Plant food','Animal food','Liquid food','Processed food']\n}\n};\n\nconst particleData = {\n'Topic particles': ['Primary topic','Secondary topic','Topic shift'],\n'Subject role particles': ['Agentive','Experiencer','Initiator'],\n'Object role particles': ['Direct object','Indirect object','Affected target'],\n'Predicate framing particles': ['State framing','Action framing'],\n'Temporal particles': ['Past marker','Present marker','Future marker'],\n'Aspectual particles': ['Continuous','Completed','Repetitive'],\n'Modal particles': ['Possibility','Necessity','Permission'],\n'Negation particles': ['Simple negation','Absolute negation'],\n'Emotional particles': ['Sorrow','Anger','Wonder'],\n'Evidential particles': ['Witnessed','Heard','Assumed'],\n'Relational particles': ['Bond','Distance','Hierarchy'],\n'Directional particles': ['Toward','Away','Across'],\n'Spatial particles': ['Above','Below','Within'],\n'Logical particles': ['And','Or','Contradiction'],\n'Clause linking particles': ['Continuation','Contrast','Cause'],\n'Focus particles': ['Emphasis focus','Exclusive focus'],\n'Emphasis particles': ['Strong emphasis','Soft emphasis'],\n'Interrogative particles': ['Question marker','Uncertainty'],\n'Comparative particles': ['Equality','Superiority','Inferiority'],\n'Quantity particles': ['Many','Few','All'],\n'Collective particles': ['Group','Swarm','Unity'],\n'Identity particles': ['Self','Other','Mirror'],\n'Transformational particles': ['Change','Mutation','Ascension'],\n'State transition particles': ['Beginning','Ending','Conversion'],\n'Resonance particles': ['Echo','Harmony','Dissonance'],\n'Silence boundary particles': ['Pause','Void break'],\n'Ceremonial particles': ['Ritual start','Blessing'],\n'Poetic particles': ['Metaphor','Rhythmic extension'],\n'Social alignment particles': ['Alliance','Opposition'],\n'Register particles': ['Formal','Informal','Sacred'],\n'Memory particles': ['Remembered','Forgotten'],\n'Perception particles': ['Seen','Felt','Imagined'],\n'Probability particles': ['Likely','Unlikely'],\n'Intent particles': ['Purpose','Desire'],\n'Causality particles': ['Cause','Effect'],\n'Conditional particles': ['If','Unless'],\n'Sequence particles': ['Before','After'],\n'Completion particles': ['Finished','Fulfilled'],\n'Continuity particles': ['Still','Ongoing'],\n'Dissolution particles': ['Decay','Dispersal'],\n'Existence particles': ['Existence','Manifestation'],\n'Absence particles': ['Void','Lack'],\n'Harmonic flow particles': ['Flow','Balance'],\n'Temporal distance particles': ['Ancient','Immediate'],\n'Relational distance particles': ['Near','Far'],\n'Identity resonance particles': ['Reflection','Twin-state'],\n'Dream and hypothetical particles': ['Dream-state','Hypothetical'],\n'Sacred and taboo particles': ['Sacred','Forbidden'],\n'Phonological operator particles': ['Stress shift','Tone shift'],\n'Breath timing particles': ['Inhale timing','Exhale timing']\n};\n\nfunction buildLetterButtons(entries, containerId, type){\n const container = document.getElementById(containerId);\n entries.forEach(item=>{\n  const letter = typeof item==='string' ? item : item.surface;\n  const button=document.createElement('button'); button.className='letter-btn';\n  button.textContent=letter;\n  button.title=typeof item==='string' ? `Special sign ${letter}` : `${item.family} · ${item.reading}`;\n  button.onclick=()=>toggleLetter(letter,button,type);container.appendChild(button);\n });\n}\nfunction toggleLetter(letter, button, type){\n const syllables=Number(document.getElementById('syllables').value);\n const selectedItems=selected[type];\n if(selectedItems.includes(letter)){\n  selected[type]=selectedItems.filter(x=>x!==letter);button.classList.remove('active');return;\n }\n const max=type==='letters'?syllables*4:4;\n if(selectedItems.length>=max){alert('Maximum selections reached for this category.');return;}\n selectedItems.push(letter);button.classList.add('active');\n}\n\nfunction populateNouns(){\nconst category = document.getElementById('nounCategory');\ncategory.innerHTML = '';\n\nObject.keys(nounData).forEach(cat=>{\nconst option = document.createElement('option');\noption.value = cat;\noption.textContent = cat;\ncategory.appendChild(option);\n});\n\npopulateSubcategories();\n}\n\nfunction populateSubcategories(){\nconst category = document.getElementById('nounCategory').value;\nconst sub = document.getElementById('nounSubcategory');\nsub.innerHTML = '';\n\nObject.keys(nounData[category]).forEach(s=>{\nconst option = document.createElement('option');\noption.value = s;\noption.textContent = s;\nsub.appendChild(option);\n});\n\npopulateMeanings();\n}\n\nfunction populateMeanings(){\nconst category = document.getElementById('nounCategory').value;\nconst sub = document.getElementById('nounSubcategory').value;\nconst meaning = document.getElementById('nounMeaning');\nmeaning.innerHTML = '';\n\nnounData[category][sub].forEach(m=>{\nconst option = document.createElement('option');\noption.value = m;\noption.textContent = m;\nmeaning.appendChild(option);\n});\n}\n\nfunction populateParticles(){\nconst category = document.getElementById('particleCategory');\ncategory.innerHTML = '';\n\nObject.keys(particleData).forEach(cat=>{\nconst option = document.createElement('option');\noption.value = cat;\noption.textContent = cat;\ncategory.appendChild(option);\n});\n\npopulateParticleSub();\n}\n\nfunction populateParticleSub(){\nconst cat = document.getElementById('particleCategory').value;\nconst sub = document.getElementById('particleSubcategory');\nsub.innerHTML = '';\n\nparticleData[cat].forEach(v=>{\nconst option = document.createElement('option');\noption.value = v;\noption.textContent = v;\nsub.appendChild(option);\n});\n}\n\nfunction getDictionary(){\nreturn JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('azaaraan_dictionary') || '[]');\n}\n\nfunction saveDictionary(data){\nlocalStorage.setItem('azaaraan_dictionary', JSON.stringify(data));\n}\n\nfunction wordExists(word){\nconst dict = getDictionary();\nreturn dict.some(entry=>entry.word === word);\n}\n\nfunction validateStructure(){\n const syllables=Number(document.getElementById('syllables').value);\n return selected.letters.length>=syllables && selected.letters.length<=syllables*4;\n}\nfunction generateCombination(){\n const pool=[...selected.letters];\n for(let i=pool.length-1;i>0;i--){const j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));[pool[i],pool[j]]=[pool[j],pool[i]]}\n for(const symbol of selected.specials){const index=Math.floor(Math.random()*(pool.length+1));pool.splice(index,0,symbol)}\n return pool.join('');\n}\n\nfunction generateWord(){\nif(!validateStructure()){\nalert('Invalid syllable structure for selected letters.');\nreturn;\n}\n\nlet attempts = 0;\nlet word = '';\n\nwhile(attempts < 500){\nword = generateCombination();\n\nif(!wordExists(word)){\nbreak;\n}\n\nattempts++;\n}\n\nif(wordExists(word)){\nalert('Unable to generate unique word.');\nreturn;\n}\n\nconst part = document.getElementById('partOfSpeech').value;\nconst syllables = document.getElementById('syllables').value;\n\nlet semantic = '';\n\nif(part === 'noun'){\nsemantic = `${document.getElementById('nounCategory').value} > ${document.getElementById('nounSubcategory').value} > ${document.getElementById('nounMeaning').value}`;\n} else {\nsemantic = `${document.getElementById('particleCategory').value} > ${document.getElementById('particleSubcategory').value}`;\n}\n\nconst entry = {\nword,\npart,\nsyllables,\nsemantic,\nletters: [...selected.letters],\nspecials: [...selected.specials],\ncreated: new Date().toLocaleString()\n};\n\nconst dict = getDictionary();\ndict.push(entry);\nsaveDictionary(dict);\n\nshowResult(entry);\nrenderDictionary();\n}\n\nfunction showResult(entry){\nconst result = document.getElementById('result');\nconst meta = document.getElementById('meta');\n\nresult.textContent = entry.word;\n\nmeta.innerHTML = `\n<b>Part of Speech:</b> ${entry.part}<br>\n<b>Syllables:</b> ${entry.syllables}<br>\n<b>Semantic Path:</b> ${entry.semantic}<br>\n<b>Letter Variants:</b> ${entry.letters.join(' ')}<br>\n<b>Special Signs:</b> ${entry.specials.join(' ')}<br>\n<b>Created:</b> ${entry.created}\n`;\n}\n\nfunction renderDictionary(){\nconst container = document.getElementById('dictionary');\ncontainer.innerHTML = '';\n\nconst dict = getDictionary();\n\nif(dict.length === 0){\ncontainer.innerHTML = 'No words generated yet.';\nreturn;\n}\n\n[...dict].reverse().forEach((entry,index)=>{\nconst div = document.createElement('div');\ndiv.className = 'entry';\n\nconst realIndex = dict.length - 1 - index;\n\ndiv.innerHTML = `\n<div style=\"font-size:28px;color:#facc15;\">${entry.word}</div>\n<div><b>Type:</b> ${entry.part}</div>\n<div><b>Meaning:</b> ${entry.semantic}</div>\n<div><b>Created:</b> ${entry.created}</div>\n<button class=\"delete-btn\" onclick=\"deleteWord(${realIndex})\">Delete (ONYX)</button>\n`;\n\ncontainer.appendChild(div);\n});\n}\n\nfunction deleteWord(index){\nconst password = prompt('Enter ONYX password to permanently delete word:');\n\nif(password !== 'ONYX'){\nalert('Incorrect password.');\nreturn;\n}\n\nconst dict = getDictionary();\ndict.splice(index,1);\nsaveDictionary(dict);\nrenderDictionary();\n\nalert('Word deleted. It can now be generated again.');\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('partOfSpeech').addEventListener('change', e=>{\nif(e.target.value === 'noun'){\n document.getElementById('nounSection').style.display = 'block';\n document.getElementById('particleSection').style.display = 'none';\n} else {\n document.getElementById('nounSection').style.display = 'none';\n document.getElementById('particleSection').style.display = 'block';\n}\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('nounCategory').addEventListener('change', populateSubcategories);\ndocument.getElementById('nounSubcategory').addEventListener('change', populateMeanings);\ndocument.getElementById('particleCategory').addEventListener('change', populateParticleSub);\n\nbuildLetterButtons(modernLetterEntries,'letterGrid','letters');\nbuildLetterButtons(availableSpecialSigns,'specialGrid','specials');\n\npopulateNouns();\npopulateParticles();\nrenderDictionary();\n</script>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
      "original_order": 1,
      "status": "source_only"
    }
  ],
